fonts-jsmath (0.090709+0-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * debian/control
    - Drop obsolete settings with ttf-jsmath
    - Drop debhelper and set debhelper-compat (= 13)
    - Set debian-fonts@lists.debian.org as Maintainer and me as Uploaders
    - Set Standards-Version: 4.5.0
    - Add Vcs-*
    - Add Rules-Requires-Root: no
    - Add Homepage
    - Set Priority: optional since extra is deprecated
    - Set Multi-Arch: foreign on package fonts-jsmath.
  * Simplify debian/rules and split to debian/install
  * Drop unnecessary debian/{README.Debian,preinst,ttf-jsmath.defoma-hints}
    (Closes: #572565)
  * debian/copyright
    - Convert to Copyright Format 1.0
  * Add debian/salsa-ci.yml
  * Trim trailing whitespace.
  * Upgrade to newer source format 3.0 (quilt).

